# React UI Standards

## Chart library
Use TradingView Lightweight Charts v4+ for candlestick rendering.
Do not use Recharts for OHLCV candlesticks.

## Data fetching
Use TanStack Query for REST calls.
Use native WebSocket with a custom hook for tick streams.
Never use useEffect for fetch logic.

## State
Use Zustand for local app state (symbol, mode, dqg status, timeframe).
Use TanStack Query cache for server data.

## DQG status
DQGStatus must always be visible.
If status is FAIL or PARTIAL, hide prediction overlay and show issue details.

## Error states
Every data-dependent component must have loading/error/empty states.
